[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS024
TITLE: Send routine phrases to the tower radio
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft shall send a routine phrase to the tower radio and shall apply a clearance only from a tower reply. A stand-by reply shall not change the clearance state. A scripted sentence that did not come from the separation guard shall not be treated as an issued clearance. Acceptance is a taxi phrase exchanged with the tower radio whose stand-by or clearance reply is applied only through the aircraft receive path.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The aircraft and the tower have to share one radio path. The pilot model is not a second clearance authority.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: High-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. The radio is the project UDP phrase port. There is no live radio and no SDR.
